<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Blasters Combo</Major>
    <Description>This combo was made for blaster
My commands are : M1 ( Neutral Light)
                                WASD ( movement )
                                Space ( Jump)
                                M2 ( Sig)
                                Shift ( Dodge/Sprint)
You need to setup the keys like that for the sucess of macro.
The combo that is in that macro is : Neutral Light -&gt; Jump-Chase-Dodge -&gt; DLight -&gt; Recovery -&gt; Neutral Light -&gt; M2+W
The combo works perfectly to finish opponent with light orange life , if the opponent have less or more than orange life the combo can fail because the distance of the blaster shots
If the enemie is light orange you can finish him with only 1 press on your macro key =)

That macro was made by : Away#7646 on day 24/05/2023
PS: I tested and made that macro on Diana </Description>
    <Comment>Discord : Away#7646</Comment>
